target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak
.DS_Store
*.iq
# Top-level `corpus/` holds live IQ captures: too large and too
# non-deterministic to commit. When we identify a known-good slice that
# exercises a specific decoder path, extract a minimal fixture and
# commit it under `crates/rs1090/tests/fixtures/` instead.
#
# The leading `/` anchors this to the repo root so `fuzz/corpus/` — our
# committed libFuzzer seed corpus — is unaffected.
/corpus/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
perf.data*
flamegraph.svg
dhat-heap.json

# Per-deployment secrets (Pi hostname, user, reference position, etc.)
# Sourced by dist/deploy.sh; see dist/.env.example for the template.
dist/.env

# Claude Code session state — local-only.
.claude/

# Xcode build output, user state, derived data.
apps/ios/SkyAR/build/
apps/ios/SkyAR/DerivedData/
**/*.xcuserstate
**/xcuserdata/

# Python venv for the differential-test harnesses
# (pyModeS pinned to v2 in scripts/diff_*.py).
.venv/
